<Base title="Incident management" current="services">
  <h1>Incident management</h1>
  <p>Clear response processes, roles and post-incident reviews that turn outages into lasting fixes.</p>
  <h2>What's included</h2>
  <p>Process design for response and escalation, on-call rota setup, and coaching for the people who respond. Post-incident reviews focus on the system, not the person, and end with actions someone owns.</p>
  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <p>Teams whose incidents keep repeating, or who have grown past informal firefighting.</p>
  <p><a class="button" href="/contact/">Talk about your incidents</a></p>
</Base>
